 "rule": "G7: 100 seeded injections in each of the plan's ten Phase 2 cells (X1 at W2 and W4, X2 at W1, W2 and W4, X6 at W1, W2 and W3, X7 at W1 and W2), each a kill and a fresh process on the same SQLite file, and in every one L (no lost run, and no effect without its record), U (recovery continues nothing and a replay the gate refuses makes no effect), D (no effect twice) and R (two independent recoveries from the same file reach the same state, and a second pass changes nothing) hold.",
